<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 02:09:36 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>Palantir 首席技术官警告人工智能安全“有效的利他主义者”正在尝试“政变”——表示“一小群技术官僚”不应该为所有人做出决定</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/palantir-cto-warns-ai-safety-effective-altruists-are-attempting-a-coup-says-tiny-group-of-technocrats-shouldnt-decide-for-every</link><description>Benzinga 和 Yahoo Finance LLC 可能通过以下链接赚取某些项目的佣金或收入。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/palantir-cto-warns-ai-safety-effective-altruists-are-attempting-a-coup-says-tiny-group-of-technocrats-shouldnt-decide-for-every.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 02:09:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/palantir-cto-warns-ai-safety-effective-altruists-are-attempting-a-coup-says-tiny-group-of-technocrats-shouldnt-decide-for-every</guid></item><item><title>癌症药物促使突变的血液干细胞变成短命的免疫细胞</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/cancer-drug-pushes-mutant-blood-stem-cells-to-become-short-lived-immune-cells</link><description>威尔康奈尔医学研究人员的一项研究表明，生物药物干扰素-α可以通过迫使突变的血液干细胞变成寿命较短的白细胞，从而使患有骨髓增殖性肿瘤的血癌患者受益。由于干扰素-α 的广泛活性可引起显着的副作用，因此根据这些机制研究结果制定更有针对性的策略可以满足癌症治疗的重要需求。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/cancer-drug-pushes-mutant-blood-stem-cells-to-become-short-lived-immune-cells.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 01:54:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/cancer-drug-pushes-mutant-blood-stem-cells-to-become-short-lived-immune-cells</guid></item><item><title>有意识人工智能的神话</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/the-mythology-of-conscious-ai</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 01:39:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/the-mythology-of-conscious-ai</guid></item><item><title>小型首次人体干细胞试验中骨质疏松症骨折率下降 94%</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/osteoporosis-fractures-fall-by-94-in-small-first-in-human-stem-cell-trial</link><description>在世界的某个地方，当您读完这句话时，一位 50 岁以上的女性已经因骨质疏松症而骨折，这是一种无声的骨病，会削弱骨骼系统的结构完整性和一个人的生活质量。由于骨矿物质密度和骨量降低，这种疾病会削弱骨骼并使其更容易骨折，估计影响欧洲、美国和日本的 7500 万人。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/osteoporosis-fractures-fall-by-94-in-small-first-in-human-stem-cell-trial2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 01:24:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/osteoporosis-fractures-fall-by-94-in-small-first-in-human-stem-cell-trial</guid></item><item><title>纳米力学可以实现类脑计算</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/nanoscale-mechanics-could-enable-brain-inspired-computing</link><description>麻省理工学院的研究人员创建了一种新的计算平台，可用于开发智能和自适应的下一代电子产品，这些电子产品可以在一个极其紧凑、节能的设备中同时执行多种功能，例如计算和存储。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/nanoscale-mechanics-could-enable-brain-inspired-computing2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 01:09:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/nanoscale-mechanics-could-enable-brain-inspired-computing</guid></item><item><title>重达 6 亿栋建筑，帮助构建更高效的未来</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/weighing-600-million-buildings-to-help-construct-a-more-efficient-future</link><description>一项新的研究有助于展示建筑商和城市规划者如何最大限度地减少容纳地球未来人口所需的材料。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/weighing-600-million-buildings-to-help-construct-a-more-efficient-future2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 00:54:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/weighing-600-million-buildings-to-help-construct-a-more-efficient-future</guid></item><item><title>黑洞射电观测的连续视频挑战冲击波理论</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/continuous-video-of-black-hole-radio-observations-challenges-shock-wave-theory</link><description>多年来，科学家主要依靠超长基线干涉测量（VLBI）等技术的无线电成像来研究来自超大质量黑洞活动星系核的喷流。这允许检测广泛的、未解析的特征，称为组件，其移动速度似乎比光速更快。然而，传统成像的分辨率较差，并且将每次观察视为一个单独的快照，从而限制了有关特征如何移动的信息。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/continuous-video-of-black-hole-radio-observations-challenges-shock-wave-theory.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 00:39:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/continuous-video-of-black-hole-radio-observations-challenges-shock-wave-theory</guid></item><item><title>编号：我们无法找到您要查找的页面</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/number-we-couldnt-locate-the-page-youre-looking-for</link><description>该链接可能已过时，或者页面已被移动。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/number2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 00:24:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/number-we-couldnt-locate-the-page-youre-looking-for</guid></item><item><title>科学家培育出具有部分人类大脑的老鼠</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-create-mice-with-part-human-brains</link><description>研究人员创造了具有半人脑的老鼠，以了解和开发治疗精神分裂症、癫痫、脑瘫、智力障碍和罕见痴呆症等疾病的新疗法。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-create-mice-with-part-human-brains.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Thu, 17 Sep 2026 00:09:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/scientists-create-mice-with-part-human-brains</guid></item><item><title>IBM 公司 Anderon 与美国商务部最终达成协议，获得 10 亿美元的 CHIPS 奖励，以加速美国纯量子代工厂的研发</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/anderon-an-ibm-company-finalizes-agreement-with-the-u-s-department-of-commerce-for-a-1-billion-chips-award-to-accelerate-rd-for-u-s-based-pure-play-quantum-foundry</link><description>Anderon 宣布根据《CHIPS 和科学法案》与美国商务部最终确定了 10 亿美元的拨款。该奖项将加速 Anderon 的研发工作，以提高国家的量子晶圆制造能力。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/anderon-an-ibm-company-finalizes-agreement-with-the-u-s-department-of-commerce-for-a-1-billion-chips-award-to-accelerate-rd-for-u-s-based-pure-play-quantum-foundry.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 23:54:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/09/anderon-an-ibm-company-finalizes-agreement-with-the-u-s-department-of-commerce-for-a-1-billion-chips-award-to-accelerate-rd-for-u-s-based-pure-play-quantum-foundry</guid></item></channel></rss>